      "id": "claim_667deaafcdff45e7b7ccb9d54850f71b",
      "statement": "The 2024-03 HO-3 Section II Coverage E pays damages for which an insured is legally liable because of bodily injury or property damage caused by an occurrence and provides a defense for covered claims or suits; Coverage E applies to insured locations and personal activities, applies separately to each insured, and does not increase the applicable limit through that separation.",
