      "statement": "HO-3 Section II Coverage F provides no-fault medical-payments coverage for necessary medical expenses from accidental bodily injury, including specified injuries away from an insured location, while its business exclusion preserves only activities ordinarily incidental to nonbusiness pursuits and its animal-away-from-location grant excludes animals used in connection with a business.",
